Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:52.64,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:20.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（对不起 我很混蛋 来华盛顿 新世界需要 瑞克·格兰姆斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:03.14,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on AMC's The Walking Dead…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是可持续生活的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the start of sustainability, community.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 他的团队非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, his group… they're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚因你而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah died because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为所有生命都很宝贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause all life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来确实不实际\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this sounds insane,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这本来就是一个疯狂的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is an insane world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们过来之前 我们要主动出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to come for them before they come for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早我们就开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it all starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾开这辆卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin gets in the truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开出口 我们就在后面就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}opens the exit and we're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跳下车 和大部队在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hops out, catches up with his team at red.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,路的西面 红气球那儿会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}staying on the west side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔骑他的摩托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl gets on his bike…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,挡不住了 我们得马上开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's open! We got to do this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾的小队 开始了 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin's group, get moving, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 瑞克 我们还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Rick, we're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莎 艾伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha! Abraham!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们现在就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight, we'll do it live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和达里尔在红气球那碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meet Daryl at red.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他引着行尸去通道那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him take them through the gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我们到时候见 - 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we meet at red. - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我在「车队」那儿会发信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I'll hit the tractor place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 还有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把他们引开 否则数量太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to take them out or they'll distract the horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:01:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来 让我帮你 - 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here, let me help. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来 - 那你得照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here! - Do everything I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会的 - 瑞克 我们得演练一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - Rick, this was supposed to be a dry run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达里尔 准备好 - 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl, get ready. - They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们没有详细讨论过整个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we haven't even gone through the whole plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想走就走 反正我们已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go back, go back. We're finishing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾 等我的指令开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin, you hit it on my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝这边来了 我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading for home. We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发射照明弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready to hit the flares.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾 发动卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin, hit the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.65,0:04:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 怎么了 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, what happened? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看起来很糟糕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys look like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine. She's fine. She's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:05:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just check on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm okay. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去了一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰到了行尸… 我们都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkers and… we're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,被乱飞的子弹误伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got winged by a ricochet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的发型没乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happened to your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 尤金吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Eugene's freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁能让诺亚来保护我一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody want to send Noah in here to protect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天再详谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should talk more tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take chances anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们各自都分配了任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all have your assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道在哪儿集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where to rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔引那些行尸过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl leads them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨莎和艾伯拉罕跟他们在山底会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha and Abraham join him at the bottom of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 当你引行尸到「车队」那儿时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, you hit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们发信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you take care of the walkers at the tractor place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们成败的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one thing we gotta get ahead of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家记得保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody keep your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面没问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is he okay with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来就是他想出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty much his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该洗个澡睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a bed and a bath,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.87,0:09:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还是和监狱一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's still a cage, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:10:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉了我那辆卡车到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me what happened out there with the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他遇见那些人的事也和你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tell you about those guys he met?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些头上有「W」的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The W's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们看见的行尸头上一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that walker we saw, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多监测点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more watch points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.77,0:10:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉狄安娜 不要再接纳任何人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna tell Deanna we don't need to go looking for people anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel different about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, people out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}they got to take care of themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他放出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该让他留在这里太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't leave him in there any longer than we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果你还在乱想些什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you're still looking to go buck wild with the breath impaired…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经问过这个问题 我也回答过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already asked the question and I already answered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么担心 干嘛还要和我一起上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were so worried, why the hell did you get into the car with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 干这种惊心动魄的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, doing something as big as this…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,才叫生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's living.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了山脚下红气球的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at red at the bottom of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.53,0:11:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 行尸部队来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here comes the parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这棍术从哪儿学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you learn that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾变之前还是之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before or after?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask, you answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本的礼貌 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's common courtesy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切发生后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 但不得不问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry for this, for having to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I look at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你走投无路时 更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes you're safer when there's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得重新了解对方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to get to know each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来了 让我们进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back. You gonna let us in or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做是不允许的 所以我不会开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm technically not authorized, so I will not be doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁啊 - 你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell are you? - You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫希恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Heath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在这儿 我的小队前几周出去执行任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live here. My team's been on a run the last couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦接纳了我和我的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron brought myself and my group here directly within that window,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们之前从没见过 我也不确定你的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we haven't had the chance to meet and I can't exactly confirm your residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我开了 要怎么确认你不是想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do, how do I know you won't attempt to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, I'm not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你让我等得越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the longer you make me wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越想狠狠揍你一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more you motivate me to beat your ass, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄安娜让你来看门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Deanna put you on gate duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是暂时顶替霍利的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I'm not proper duty. This is Holly's shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚好经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just walking by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她问我能不能顶替她一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asked if I could relieve her for a few ticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说「不行 谢谢」 但她完全无视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "no, thank you" and she ignored me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我在这等了她好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is obviously what I should have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都没有回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}as it's been at least five ticks and still no Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫斯科特 她叫安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Scott. This is Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.31,0:14:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们团队有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of you are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,十三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}13.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 十二个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll close up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在的时候发生了什么大事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything big happen while we were gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.94,0:15:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我们开了个会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we had a meeting last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 讨论了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是去问狄安娜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to talk to Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她亲自和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it from the horse. Her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.71,0:15:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,明吧什么意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 很高兴遇到和我一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's good to see someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.77,0:15:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fully respect the hair game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁建的围墙 - 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who put up the wall? - They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个叫雷格的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a man, Reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.37,0:15:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做的计划 一直持续了下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drew up plans, made it happen early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有好多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been inside from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.59,0:15:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有食物 有能源 行尸也不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had food, energy, not a whole lot of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么生活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要拼了命活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't had to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认清我们之后 接纳了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They figured that out, brought us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来还是太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still might be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太后知后觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For them to come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去和狄安娜聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to talk to Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是这里管事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the woman in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前是雷格的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was married to Reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有两具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have two men here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手不能埋在社区里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna bury killers inside these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这你做不了主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把尸体搬走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去西边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着布兰顿路开几英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down Branton Road a few miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了桥就停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just past the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再远我们也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't go out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把他扔树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the trees have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开枪打死他 因为他杀了雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot him because he killed Reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这个原因 我们没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was it. We didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have a cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是为杀手准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是杀手 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a killer, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杀手 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, and you are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 你们到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, you there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了 我们到之前能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost. We'll have it handled before they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在黄色气球这里见\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll meet you at yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,能挡住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我们站的地方有多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, considering where we're standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前你在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back when you were in that place…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I lived…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是拿了我一根蛋白棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you take one of my protein bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我发誓那里还剩一罐花生酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I could have sworn there was one more peanut butter left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就是这样的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是觉得还剩一罐花生酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always think there's one more peanut butter left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.51,0:20:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就把他扔这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we just leave him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.77,0:20:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.91,0:21:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这做什么 罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out here, Ron?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道我爸被埋在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to know where my dad was buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.83,0:24:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,社区是如何一直保存的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the community's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让部分行尸留在围墙边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've had walkers at their walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是更多的行尸 可以说大量的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a lot of them, maybe most of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都困在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they wound up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.09,0:24:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.62,0:25:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗恩 - 我要回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ron. - I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.42,0:25:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.14,0:25:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.14,0:25:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我怎么想的 是我知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what I think, it's what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.71,0:25:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保护不了你自己 我会教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't protect yourself. I'll show you how,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.08,0:25:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在你不知道自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but right now you have no idea what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.78,0:25:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是离开 必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you come out here, you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,死得绝不痛快 而且不会就这么死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it won't be quick and it won't ever be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你会变成它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you'll be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.21,0:25:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是会发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.89,0:25:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要和我们一起回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming back with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.03,0:25:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我难做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make it hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.98,0:26:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 你得快点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, you have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.28,0:26:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音会把尸群从路上吸引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The noise could distract the herd right off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回话 - 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talk to me. - We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.21,0:26:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来数量不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.94,0:26:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得让它们安静 - 你打算怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need it quiet. - So what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.97,0:27:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们放出来 每次就放几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take 'em out a few at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯 你去门那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas, you're at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就放一两个出来 然后关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let one or two out and then you close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.27,0:27:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直这么做 这就是计划 这样来控制它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep doing that. That's the trick. That's how we control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.69,0:27:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,希恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heath…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.02,0:27:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 万一门他关不上怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what if he can't close it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以的 - 那我们就带上它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be able to. - Then we take them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take them on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.87,0:27:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有麻烦了 我们就跑去房子后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get into trouble, we go behind the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.13,0:27:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入林子 把他们一起引过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the woods and we draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.54,0:27:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 他来的时候你还在外面执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you've been out on runs since he got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.32,0:27:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他清楚自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.50,0:27:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和艾登完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Aiden, we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.31,0:27:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该先彩排一下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was supposed to be a dress rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.70,0:27:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来应该在送披萨的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be delivering pizzas, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.15,0:27:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔在把它们带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl's leading them this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.47,0:27:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音会把尸群从路上吸引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That noise is gonna pull the herd right off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.11,0:27:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候我们问题就大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we have serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.29,0:27:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.46,0:27:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了吗 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.42,0:27:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.83,0:27:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.55,0:28:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到三 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.50,0:28:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.59,0:28:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.50,0:28:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}My team…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.13,0:28:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早些时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw it early on,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.77,0:28:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做第一班侦查的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}back when we were on one of those first scouts,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.66,0:28:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄清楚了周围的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}finding out what was around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.07,0:28:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,山脚下有一个营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a camp at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.11,0:28:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,事态恶化的时候 那些人肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people, they must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.12,0:28:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,用一辆卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}blocked the exits with one of those trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.22,0:28:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵住了缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}back when everything started to go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.11,0:28:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没成功 都成了行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't make it. They were all roamers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.78,0:28:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有十几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a dozen of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.28,0:28:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后一个都没回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's been back since?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.58,0:28:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.19,0:28:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有值得搜刮的城镇都在另一个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every town worth scavenging are all in the other direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.09,0:29:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never really felt like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.35,0:29:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个变成行尸的营地边上野餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}having a picnic next to the camp that ate itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.47,0:29:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是声音在吸引行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all the while the walkers have been drawn by the sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些行尸弄出更多声音 吸引了更多的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're making more sound and they're drawing more in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.29,0:29:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.53,0:29:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what I'm proposing,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.21,0:29:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds risky,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.15,0:29:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是行尸已经要从出口处溜过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but walkers are already slipping through the exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.31,0:29:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个行尸可以钻过来的卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the trucks keeping the walkers in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.95,0:29:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚有一天会抵挡不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}could go off the edge any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.82,0:29:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就是一场大雨的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe after one more hard rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.98,0:29:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个出口朝东\N{\fnArial\fs30}That exit sends them east.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.89,0:29:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有僵尸都会向东而来 正对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them. Right at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.64,0:29:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题不是那辆卡车是否挡得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about if it gives,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.79,0:29:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是它什么时候挡不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's when.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.45,0:29:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定会发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.27,0:29:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们要尽快动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we have to do this soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.33,0:29:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是… 我简直无法形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… I don't even have another word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.35,0:29:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.91,0:29:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个都太吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.69,0:29:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是听起来也似乎没有其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't sound like there's any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.60,0:29:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.14,0:30:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们就不能加固一下薄弱的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, couldn't we just build up the weak spots?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以画个草图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could draw up plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.25,0:30:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当年和雷格一起建了围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked on the wall with reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.90,0:30:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有施工队在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Construction crew…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.74,0:30:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以尝试修复那个漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can try and make it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.33,0:30:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们加固了 那些行尸的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we could, the sound of those walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.71,0:30:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在不停地吸引更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}is drawing more and more every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.10,0:30:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,加固那个出口没有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Building up the exits won't change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.02,0:30:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按瑞克说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do what Rick says,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.57,0:30:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,照他的计划来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the plan he's laid out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.23,0:30:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟大家说过 达里尔会把它们引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you all, we're gonna have Daryl leading them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.94,0:30:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.83,0:30:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车和他一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take a car, ride next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.29,0:30:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让他一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't just be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.57,0:30:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来引着它们移动 达里尔确保它们跟紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep 'em coming, Daryl keeps 'em from getting sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.62,0:30:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和她一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人撑全程太辛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long way to white-knuckle it solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.08,0:30:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分两个小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have two teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.15,0:30:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在森林的两边协助计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}One on each side of the forest helping manage this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从现在开始就需要有人设岗值班\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have a few people on watch from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.91,0:31:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让罗西塔 斯潘塞 还有霍利来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita, Spencer, and Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.87,0:31:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们除外\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.88,0:31:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.28,0:31:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.62,0:31:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该盯着她点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.08,0:31:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续按你说的计划做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going with the plans you talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.11,0:31:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.80,0:31:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.30,0:31:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在人人自危\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要看到她平安归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to see her come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.78,0:31:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是唯一原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.83,0:31:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 并不止这个原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.72,0:31:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.54,0:31:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.75,0:31:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to help as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.15,0:31:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 还有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.99,0:31:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.84,0:31:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be another play.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.09,0:31:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能控制得了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just control that many.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.81,0:31:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前说过 赶行尸就像放牧一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it before, walkers herd up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.66,0:31:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有东西吸引它们它们就会沿着一个方向走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll follow a path if something's drawing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.38,0:31:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们能把它们一网打尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we can get 'em all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.16,0:31:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 我们就应该相信你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? We're supposed to just take your word for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.84,0:32:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就应该乖乖跟从你 即使你之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all supposed to just fall in line behind you after…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.08,0:32:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.46,0:32:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前你到处喊打喊杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you wave a gun around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.10,0:32:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱嚷乱叫 用枪威胁别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}screaming, pointing it at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.69,0:32:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还打死了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you shoot a man in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.92,0:32:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 之前你… - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After you… - Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.74,0:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.95,0:32:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.50,0:32:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你需要怎样 我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you need, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.34,0:32:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人参加吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.86,0:32:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.02,0:32:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须这样做 我需要出份力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do this. I need to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.99,0:32:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.37,0:33:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.07,0:33:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会成功的 我们会保护这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make this work. We'll keep this place safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.46,0:33:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我们的家 我们能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep our families safe. We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.95,0:33:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你计划再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan. Go through it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.02,0:33:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 他刚才说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, he just said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.40,0:33:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细地再讲一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every part again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.49,0:33:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括具体的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exact plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.01,0:33:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马歇尔大道与雷丁大道交叉路口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshall and Redding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.16,0:34:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在这儿把它们向西引 - 怎么引\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We force them west here. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.23,0:34:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把其他路封住\N{\fnArial\fs30}We block it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.22,0:34:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们只能沿一个方向走\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can only go one way,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.58,0:34:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,向西 远离社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}west, away from the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.91,0:34:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,用什么把路封住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block it off with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.90,0:34:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.19,0:34:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那些旅行车 大卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll use the rvs, some of the bigger trucks,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.55,0:34:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,首尾相连地停住\N{\fnArial\fs30}park them end to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.55,0:34:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把它们引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be drawing them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.85,0:34:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会一直往外走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.03,0:34:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但是引开那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that many?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.28,0:34:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就用区区几辆小车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just bouncing off some sedans?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后当它们从这儿通过之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when they start slipping through.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.60,0:34:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些掉队的会分散其他的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the ones that walk away start distracting the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.11,0:34:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们的计划就失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you stop drawing them away?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.23,0:34:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.35,0:34:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一些板子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.76,0:34:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,工地上那种很大的金属板\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big-ass metal ones from the construction site.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.55,0:34:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用它们来加固通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use them to fortify the whip wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.23,0:34:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可以帮助分散行尸冲撞的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd help disperse the force of impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.83,0:34:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让行尸顺畅地被引走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and direct the walkers clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.46,0:34:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像台球 击打八号球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a pool table.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.35,0:34:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的球都会被弹到球袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight ball, corner pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.39,0:34:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面可是一整个行尸军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an army out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.56,0:34:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这东西没撑住又会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens when this doesn't hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.32,0:34:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会冲过来 山坡里的这个拐弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they push on through. The curve in this hillside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.58,0:34:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让它们掉头向东\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna send them right back east.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.66,0:35:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,直直地冲向我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.31,0:35:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真的要冒这个险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seriously want to risk that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.49,0:35:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你需要帮助我们让它撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you need to help us to make it hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.36,0:35:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你修建了那些墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}These walls, you built them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.46,0:35:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你已经完成过这样不可能的任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've already done the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.38,0:35:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.45,0:35:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.86,0:35:29.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马歇尔大道与雷丁大道交叉路口）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.40,0:37:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你之前说的 我们要顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you said before about us needing to take care of ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.26,0:37:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去找到更多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going out finding more people,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.43,0:37:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是顾好我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is taking care of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.82,0:37:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 决定权在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.51,0:38:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.18,0:38:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以和你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can come with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和达里尔已经教会了我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Daryl have been teaching me how to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.84,0:38:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉着你已经掌握诀窍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该留在后方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should stay back,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.36,0:38:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受其他人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}get a feel for how people feel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.82,0:38:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和他们还有相处很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still got a long way to go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.70,0:38:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.98,0:38:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面上 她是在掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.60,0:38:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实掌权的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're in charge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.84,0:38:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这可不是个好办法 - 这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a bad idea. - This is the only idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.58,0:38:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉着里面大概有十多只左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's something like a dozen in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.76,0:38:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们退后 往反方向跑 把往两个方向引\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay back, we get on opposite ends, we draw them to each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.72,0:38:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后一人杀四个 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try and take down four each? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.46,0:38:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我和希恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just me and Heath.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.09,0:39:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回去留在后方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get back and you stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.19,0:39:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情要是进展的不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things go south,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.20,0:39:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就告诉瑞克 你把它们引走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell Rick and you draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.87,0:39:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just move back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.12,0:39:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害死了诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got Noah killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.86,0:39:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.79,0:39:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所做的还不止这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.76,0:39:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把格伦骗进树林试图杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lured Glenn into the woods and tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.58,0:39:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.05,0:39:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.94,0:39:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦说我大可以告诉所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn told me I could tell everyone if that's what I wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前尼古拉斯差点被赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could get Nicholas exiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.97,0:39:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,被赶到外面自生自灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd die out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.98,0:39:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,本可以那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.44,0:39:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在也可以这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.99,0:39:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害死了诺亚还试图杀死格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got Noah killed and he tried to kill Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.12,0:39:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦救了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn saves people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.95,0:39:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使大家都能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.66,0:40:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我怎么样都接受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't accept it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.96,0:40:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想到了之前的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I thought about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.16,0:40:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起了我人生中最幽暗的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we were on different sides of that fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.73,0:40:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们站在监狱栅栏的两侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the worst day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.99,0:40:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在却是世上我最在乎的人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're one of the most important people in the world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.68,0:40:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things can get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.83,0:40:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能让一切好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make them better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.48,0:40:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在告诉我你想怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.88,0:40:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全听你的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna follow your lead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.28,0:40:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.24,0:40:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.93,0:40:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.46,0:40:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 不过看你是不会等我们准备好了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But since you're doing this thing anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.26,0:40:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.84,0:41:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.39,0:41:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.05,0:41:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.57,0:41:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.46,0:42:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.61,0:42:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.41,0:42:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是卡罗尔 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Carol, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.32,0:42:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.97,0:42:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟着瑞克多久了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been with Rick long?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.90,0:42:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从亚特兰大开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.60,0:42:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是警察吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And were you a cop, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.93,0:42:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.95,0:42:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.81,0:42:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.40,0:42:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻准备着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seem ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.11,0:42:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.93,0:42:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, to handle things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.87,0:42:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很会说话嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.85,0:43:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.38,0:43:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些「调皮的」行尸离开大部队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got some looky-loos taking a little constitutional off the shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.79,0:43:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始散开走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They starting a damn walkout.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.14,0:43:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让达里尔把他们引回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to have Daryl circle back?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.69,0:43:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.58,0:43:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续开车 我很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving. I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.73,0:43:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.28,0:43:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻大个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.12,0:43:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.75,0:43:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车就在那儿 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my ride, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.44,0:43:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 瞧瞧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.21,0:44:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到那天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see Reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.65,0:44:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷格被杀得情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}the night he got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.01,0:44:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.11,0:44:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.46,0:44:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脸就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His face just…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.08,0:44:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,像火山口那样炸开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blowing up like Pompeii.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.06,0:44:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们所有人眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}right when we were cheek to cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.38,0:44:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总觉得耳朵里还有他的脑浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think I got some of his brains in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.55,0:44:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧后面的大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.04,0:44:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.29,0:44:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情又回到我们所计划的那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is aces again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.29,0:44:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚那是在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.06,0:44:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是让那帮蠢行尸别掉队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just grabbing the bull by the nutsack.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.52,0:45:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在生存 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm living, darling,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.42,0:45:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.11,0:45:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没来得及说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had a chance to say it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.33,0:45:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷格的事 我真的很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sorry about reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.31,0:45:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个聪明 善良的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was smart and kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.56,0:45:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.79,0:45:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个决定很正确 我们需要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the right call. We need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.11,0:45:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.82,0:45:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.84,0:45:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在社区内 每个人也该配上武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}People need to be armed inside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.74,0:45:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要锻炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to be trained, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.83,0:45:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.22,0:46:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.53,0:46:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 注意那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.97,0:46:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用铲子打 开枪会引来更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your shovels. The guns will draw more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.27,0:46:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.09,0:46:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能行的 你们都要学会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this. You need to, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.01,0:46:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根 别插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.09,0:46:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你不想再冒任何险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you don't take chances anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.86,0:47:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说明天要演习\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's talking about a dry run tomorrow. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.62,0:47:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克阻止了皮特 他阻止了皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick stopped Pete. He stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.75,0:47:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和除掉家暴者无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not taking out a wife-beater.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.85,0:47:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是杀人凶手 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a murderer, Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.25,0:47:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克的计划就等于去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Rick wants to do is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.99,0:47:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 斯潘塞 狄安娜已经神志不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Spencer, but Deanna is asleep at the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.85,0:47:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这就靠我们了 我们得阻止瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's on us. We have got to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.31,0:47:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个牧师说的关于瑞克和那伙人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the priest said about him, about these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.25,0:47:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.58,0:47:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们动手之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more of us have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.92,0:47:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要有多少自己人白白牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.76,0:47:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再晚就来不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause pretty soon it's gonna be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.97,0:47:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 你要十分小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, you need to be really careful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.44,0:47:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我们去找狄安娜跟她说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about us going to Deanna and telling her…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.76,0:47:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没说要去找谁谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, I'm not talking about talking some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.64,0:47:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的不是谈话 会议什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About meetings. I'm not talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.31,0:48:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单粗暴 在他杀我们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plain and simple, we kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.66,0:48:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he kills us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.85,0:48:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.33,0:48:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.43,0:48:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他都听到了 - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He heard. - I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.30,0:48:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 我没听到… - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, I didn't… - Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.37,0:48:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.52,0:48:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 别 你不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, don't. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.27,0:48:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.01,0:48:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.37,0:48:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要从你手中夺回这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking this place back from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.78,0:48:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们在这儿讨论的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you were talking about in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.19,0:48:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他一个人这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.88,0:49:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我 我会让人把风的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I would have… I would have set up some lookouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.19,0:49:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是聪明的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would have been the smart thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.03,0:49:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 要是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if I happened to…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.29,0:49:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为你能从我手中夺回这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think you're gonna take this community from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.22,0:49:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从格伦 米琼恩手中？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Glenn? From Michonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.45,0:49:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从达里尔手中？从我手中？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Daryl? From me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.38,0:49:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白你在跟谁说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea who you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.54,0:49:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我一个人说的 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was just me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.50,0:49:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是… 我一个人的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was… it was just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.74,0:49:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.45,0:49:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.37,0:49:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.64,0:49:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.86,0:50:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以试着和我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can try to work with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.76,0:50:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以试着活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can try to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.96,0:50:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会这么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.72,0:50:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.06,0:50:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.92,0:50:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 是时候结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, we need to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.12,0:51:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继续移动 然后将尸群从前往后排好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to keep moving and fan out down that thing front to back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.82,0:51:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像维持游行秩序的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we said, cops at a parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.84,0:51:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 你在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, you take the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.59,0:51:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿着另一个对讲机 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got the other walkie. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.56,0:51:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是尸群散了 我们就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it gets sloppy, we fire our weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.35,0:51:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们引回路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}pull them back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.59,0:51:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去前面 好 一个接一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hit the front. Okay, one after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.02,0:52:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,托宾 它们散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tobin, they're breaking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.03,0:52:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.36,0:52:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪把他们引回路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire your guns and draw them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.29,0:52:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋外很舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.57,0:52:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.43,0:52:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不要介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.43,0:52:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想晚上吹吹风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to enjoy the evening a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.88,0:52:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那屋没有门廊 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't have a porch over there, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.97,0:52:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.44,0:52:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和我们一起住在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should stay with us over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.27,0:52:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多余的屋子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got room?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.85,0:52:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.30,0:52:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要再那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to do that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.94,0:52:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩根 我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.00,0:53:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便这是第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if this is the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.64,0:53:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,想抱抱她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hold her?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.76,0:53:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.02,0:53:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.01,0:53:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.57,0:53:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.36,0:53:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.26,0:53:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.29,0:53:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.51,0:53:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在军械库时和卡特一起的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with that man Carter, in the armory…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.78,0:54:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.85,0:54:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是和当初我在金县遇见时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still the same man I met in king county.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.97,0:54:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那个回来 还告诉我事情没结束的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that came back and told me it wasn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.84,0:54:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.05,0:54:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,和现在我面前的这个人 一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same you that's right in front of me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.04,0:54:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.03,0:54:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.62,0:54:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I wouldn't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.82,0:54:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他那种秉性\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how he could screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.41,0:54:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会通多少篓子 做多少蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what stupid thing he'd do next because that's who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.17,0:54:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他这种人现在就不该活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just somebody who shouldn't be alive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.59,0:54:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.90,0:54:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我突然想到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all that hit me and…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.47,0:54:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用非杀他不可了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized I didn't have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.77,0:55:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.83,0:55:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他那样的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.70,0:55:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早有天会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna die no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.08,0:55:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.87,0:55:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.46,0:55:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.68,0:55:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god! Be quiet. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.20,0:55:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 卡特 嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. Carter. Carter, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.66,0:55:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.51,0:55:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.11,0:55:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.47,0:56:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪声让那群家伙又回到了路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gunfire is bringing them back on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.29,0:56:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你盯着点它们 托宾 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got them, Tobin. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.74,0:56:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在尖叫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.49,0:56:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.21,0:56:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脸上被咬了一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got bit right in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.11,0:56:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了不让他尸变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.19,0:56:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在把它们引去那片树林前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a good hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.40,0:56:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有整整一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we have 'em to green.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.44,0:56:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们把它们交给达里尔 萨莎 艾伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we hand them off to Daryl, Sasha, and Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.10,0:56:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回去给大家说说到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you head back, tell everyone what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.62,0:56:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 瑞克 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Rick, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.45,0:56:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.34,0:56:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个我来解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.35,0:56:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩 你来选点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, you take point.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.60,0:57:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.35,0:57:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.16,0:57:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.69,0:57:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.45,0:57:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.94,0:57:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为明天多准备些照明弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just getting more flares for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.18,0:58:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I haven't…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.37,0:58:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是… 我想如果让事情顺其自然的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I just thought it might be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.35,0:58:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定才是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I let things be for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.19,0:58:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩告诉我发生的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.86,0:58:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你谈谈那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wanted to talk to you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.70,0:58:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不应该出现在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shouldn't have been out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.13,0:58:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他不应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.39,0:58:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.52,0:58:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能那样对他说话 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't talk to him like that, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.49,0:58:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.85,0:58:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.80,0:58:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗恩必须仔细听我讲的每一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron needed to hear every word I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.88,0:58:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我抓他的原因 我不是在生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I grabbed him. I wasn't angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.73,0:58:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just telling him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.76,0:58:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真相来源于你 他听不进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's coming from you, he can't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.23,0:58:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得明白这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.06,0:58:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要知道怎么保护他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to know how to handle himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.98,0:59:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以教他 我可以教你 - 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can teach him. I can teach you. - Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.29,0:59:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得知道怎么做 - 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to know how. - Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.55,0:59:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道我们可以有枪时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I found out we could have them,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.12,0:59:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始让罗西塔教我怎么射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked Rosita to start showing me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.80,0:59:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？她教我 然后我再教罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? She's gonna teach me and I'm gonna teach Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.03,0:59:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,再教山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna teach Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.96,0:59:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了你在会上对我们说的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I heard what you were saying to us at the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.70,0:59:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有以前在我家 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at my house before, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.17,0:59:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会战斗的 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna fight, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.66,1:00:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这是终点线\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this is the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.25,1:00:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把它们引到这 我们就撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we make it to green, we fall back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.69,1:00:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些沟渠土坎会把它们困在大路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ditches and ridges will keep them on the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家 但 达里尔 萨莎 艾伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We head home, but Daryl, Sasha, and Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.11,1:00:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,会再把它们引到二十英里以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}take them the rest of the way, 20 miles more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.72,1:00:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.83,1:00:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.62,1:00:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就明天公路之旅前的一个小疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some intel before our little road trip tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.25,1:00:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,问吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.23,1:00:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么做 是因为你想寻死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doing this 'cause you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.50,1:00:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.05,1:01:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将引它们通过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna take 'em right past here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.46,1:01:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些声音会吸引它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that noise could distract them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.56,1:01:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚回去的时候把这清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll clear it on our way back tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.98,1:01:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想明天出任何意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want any surprises tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.74,1:01:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为你的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you've done,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.90,1:01:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,承担后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna sit with it a while,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.01,1:01:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不想你明天出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I don't want you out here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.63,1:01:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.65,1:01:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.70,1:01:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快了 我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some time soon, I'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.06,1:01:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就好好做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you start to make it right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.30,1:01:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.49,1:02:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来确实不实际\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this sounds insane,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.11,1:02:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这本来就是一个疯狂的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is an insane world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.17,1:02:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们过来之前 我们要主动出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to come for them before they come for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.64,1:02:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.04,1:02:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.72,1:02:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是号角声还是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a horn or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.47,1:03:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面队伍的僵尸开始离队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pulling the back half off the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.73,1:03:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.08,1:03:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那是什么 很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever that is, it's far.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.60,1:03:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它听起来 像是从… 家那边传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like it's coming from… home.
